      "sc:description": "ViralQuest is an interactive pipeline designed for the post-assembly analysis and characterization of viral sequences derived from high-throughput sequencing (HTS) metagenomic data. It automates identification, performs functional annotation, and generates comprehensive, visual HTML reports for in-depth virome analysis.",
